<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I am the culprit...?<PG>
Ah, the one who seemed to be the culprit a moment ago and I are dressed the same, after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
It is only natural that you would hold such a doubt.<PG>
If you say you cannot trust me, then that is the end of it, but to be sure, I will state it clearly. It would trouble me if a problem arose in the trust between <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama and me.<PG>
The one from earlier and I are entirely different people.<PG>
As for why I am dressed in this way, it is because I have a physical feature that I would rather <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama did not see.<PG>
This Noh mask and these red robes are only to hide it. They have no meaning beyond that.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------